					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This didn't make me laugh. Maybe because I'm tired. It just made me depressed.<br /> Nitpick: I don't think they'd send in lethal force to deal with one guy with no combat experience and a weapon known to impair combat abilities. They probably have security forces specifically for dealing with non-lethal situations like that. I don't think the Foundation's all guns, all the time.<br /> This is just too sad for me, at the moment. Novote.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
